  message: "Done in PR #2291 (dev 703dce32b; commit 8e52dccc0). Live on dev 703dce32b: python ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/fast_smart_test_build_11172026/closure_pr3/sig_repros.py haras -> 'ALL OK (6/6)': normalize_rust_signature('(self: &Self)') = '()' == '(&self)' = '()' (the item's repro was !=); '(self: &mut Self)' == '(&mut self)' = '(&mut Self)'; '(mut self)' == '(self)' = '(Self)'; \"(&'_ self)\" == '(&self)'; controls stay distinct: '(&self)' vs '(&mut self)', and \"(&'a self)\" (named lifetime kept) vs '(&self)'. Evidence: ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/fast_smart_test_build_11172026/closure_pr3/haras.txt"  # 84e8
